719:/// True when this one `io::Error` reports volume-level unwritability:
720:/// the medium refuses writes (read-only mount, write-protected disk), or
721:/// it has no room left for them (cr-pfc3-1: full volume, exhausted
722:/// quota).
723:fn io_error_says_volume_unwritable(error: &std::io::Error) -> bool {
724:    matches!(
725:        error.kind(),
726:        std::io::ErrorKind::ReadOnlyFilesystem
727:            | std::io::ErrorKind::StorageFull
728:            | std::io::ErrorKind::QuotaExceeded
729:    ) || error
